OL,3,GNEWSAGhostly trail brings a chill to
OL,4,Acity centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn illuminated trail of ghostly
OL,7,Fsculptures has gone on display in one
OL,8,Fof Europe's most haunted cities.
OL,10,FGhosts After Dark, which runs from 4 to
OL,11,F8 November, features 70 wire-mesh
OL,12,Fspectres hidden in and around the
OL,13,Fgrounds of York's Museum Gardens.
OL,15,FYork is reputed to have 140 real ghosts
OL,16,Fwithin its walls, with 15 alone said to
OL,17,Ffrequent the Golden Fleece pub,
OL,18,Foverlooking the Shambles.
OL,23,APub: 04-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,388,380,200,160,0,100
