OL,3,GNEWSAGhostly trail brings a chill to
OL,4,Acity centre
OL,5,
OL,6,FJocelyn Palmer, from York Museums
OL,7,FTrust, said: "The ghosts are a
OL,8,Fwell-loved part of the city's autumnal
OL,9,Fcalendar, and we're delighted to be
OL,10,Fhosting them all together again for
OL,11,Fthis series of evening events."
